    "cost_closing_html":  "About \u003cstrong\u003e$1.41 a bowl\u003c/strong\u003e for chicken inasal with rice. Filipino barbecue plates run $12 to $15 at the restaurants that serve them, and the closest one might be a state away. Your version is 14 servings deep.",
